  "description": "You can print them at home or a local printing shop and easily use them in your bullet journal, planners, scrapbooking, card making, decoration, and many more projects.\nPNG Printable stickers with offset border-ready contours.\nWhat’s included:\n🦋13 individual PNG files with transparent background (with cutline border / 300 dpi)\n🦋5 JPG sticker sheets with all 13 stickers (A4 , A5, A6 , US letter, Half letter / 300 dpi )\n🦋5 PNG sticker sheets with all 13 stickers (A4, A5, A6, US letter, Half letter / transparent background / 300 dpi )\n🦋5 PDF sticker sheets with all 13 stickers (A4 , A5, A6 , US letter, Half letter / 300 dpi )\nWarm notes: PNG works on most graphic software (i.e. Adobe Photoshop& Ai), and has suitable formats for any online editor (for example CANVA).",
  "fullDescription": "<p>You can print them at home or a local printing shop and easily use them in your bullet journal, planners, scrapbooking, card making, decoration, and many more projects.<br>\nPNG Printable stickers with offset border-ready contours.</p>\n<p>What’s included:<br>\n🦋13 individual PNG files with transparent background (with cutline border / 300 dpi)<br>\n🦋5 JPG sticker sheets with all 13 stickers (A4 , A5, A6 , US letter, Half letter / 300 dpi )<br>\n🦋5 PNG sticker sheets with all 13 stickers (A4, A5, A6, US letter, Half letter / transparent background / 300 dpi )<br>\n🦋5 PDF sticker sheets with all 13 stickers (A4 , A5, A6 , US letter, Half letter / 300 dpi )</p>\n<p>Warm notes: PNG works on most graphic software (i.e. Adobe Photoshop&amp; Ai), and has suitable formats for any online editor (for example CANVA).</p>",
